     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "student is disputing P4 late penalty. syllabus: 3 free late days total for the semester, after that 10%/day. they used 2 on P2 and 2 on P4, so 1 day over -> -10%. they say \"late days\" means 24h after the deadline and they submitted 25h late so they think it's only 1 late day for p4. our canvas shows 25h 12m. help me write a reply thats firm but nice. instructor said keep the penalty"
     ]
