     "parts": [
      "Then quote it and make the logic explicit:\n\n> The syllabus says \"Each late day is a 24-hour extension.\" A submission 25 hours 12 minutes late needs two 24-hour extensions to be on time, so P4 used 2 late days.\n\nThat's clean. If they push back again, hand it to the instructor. Don't get into a third email."
